# The word recordings moved to their own Pages project (eng-pwa-audio) so
# they can never push the app deployment over Cloudflare's 20,000-file limit.
# Old clients — pages cached before v4.9.2 — still request them from this
# origin; without this rule the SPA fallback answers 200 text/html and the
# service worker would cache that HTML as the word's "recording" forever.
/audio/words/* https://eng-pwa-audio.pages.dev/audio/words/:splat 301
